_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 92
---
order: 92
---
short_label: X.92
---
statement: If an area is contained by a rational straight line and a second apotome, then the side of the area is a first apotome of a medial straight line.
---
proof:

Let the area *AB* be contained by the rational straight line *AC* and the second apotome *AD*.

I say that the side of the area *AB* is a first apotome of a medial straight line.

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="410" height="190" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="X.92 diagram" src="propX92.gif"/></noscript>
<script type="text/javascript">
    geomlib.init({
